    "axis": "relevance",
    "evidence": "The screen directly demonstrates the intent-integrity thesis: one bounded agentic-checkout event is submitted through POST /compose, then Legacy Rules ALLOW is contrasted with Intent Integrity BLOCK on that same event. Payment-relevant controls, five evidence layers, fused risk, decision reasons, latency, and a control outcome make the defense legible across all viewports. Real-server 200 responses and no browser failures support a credible live demo. However, the screenshots provide no explicit Mastercard-specific integration, network-data provenance, or quantified payment-fraud/business impact.",
